---
// Experiment 2-10 outcomes per compression strategy: tokens, ratio, iterations, result and a token-usage bar (redraw of Fig 2-16).
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 532"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-cc-title d2-cc-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-cc-title">Comparison of context compression strategies</title>
	<desc id="d2-cc-desc">
		A table of six strategies with tokens, compression ratio, iterations, result and a token-usage bar. No
		compression: 166,043 tokens, 102.1%, 5 iterations, failed. Individual summary: 276,608 tokens, 10.9%, 12
		iterations, success. Combined summary: 93,449 tokens, 4.3%, 10 iterations, success. Context-aware, highlighted
		with a colored row: 40,157 tokens, 3.0%, 7 iterations, success. Awareness plus citation (context-aware with
		citations): 222,992 tokens, 4.1%, 10 iterations, success. Adaptive window: 174,601 tokens, 102.4%, 7 iterations,
		success. Context-aware compression: 76% fewer tokens than no compression, tied for fewest iterations. Key:
		incorporate query intent and existing information into compression decisions.
	</desc>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">Comparison of context compression strategies</text>

	<!-- Header -->
	<text x="12" y="66" font-weight="700">Strategy</text>
	<text x="282" y="66" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">Tokens</text>
	<text x="348" y="66" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">Ratio</text>
	<text x="400" y="66" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">Iters</text>
	<text x="416" y="66" font-weight="700">Result</text>
	<text x="540" y="66" font-weight="700">Token usage</text>
	<line x1="4" y1="78" x2="716" y2="78" style="stroke: var(--dg-neutral-stroke); stroke-width: 2"></line>

	<!-- 1. No compression -->
	<text x="12" y="113">No compression</text>
	<text x="282" y="113" text-anchor="end">166,043</text>
	<text x="348" y="113" text-anchor="end">102.1%</text>
	<text x="400" y="113" text-anchor="end">5</text>
	<text x="416" y="113" class="dg-fail" style="font-size: 16px">✗ Failed</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="540" y="92" width="96" height="32" rx="3"></rect>
	</g>

	<!-- 2. Individual summary -->
	<text x="12" y="165">Individual summary</text>
	<text x="282" y="165" text-anchor="end">276,608</text>
	<text x="348" y="165" text-anchor="end">10.9%</text>
	<text x="400" y="165" text-anchor="end">12</text>
	<text x="416" y="165" class="dg-ok" style="font-size: 16px">✓ Success</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="540" y="144" width="160" height="32" rx="3"></rect>
	</g>

	<!-- 3. Combined summary -->
	<text x="12" y="217">Combined summary</text>
	<text x="282" y="217" text-anchor="end">93,449</text>
	<text x="348" y="217" text-anchor="end">4.3%</text>
	<text x="400" y="217" text-anchor="end">10</text>
	<text x="416" y="217" class="dg-ok" style="font-size: 16px">✓ Success</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="540" y="196" width="54" height="32" rx="3"></rect>
	</g>

	<!-- 4. Context-aware (highlighted) -->
	<g class="dg-container dg-model">
		<rect x="4" y="236" width="712" height="48" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="12" y="269" font-weight="700">Context-aware</text>
		<text x="282" y="269" text-anchor="end">40,157</text>
		<text x="348" y="269" text-anchor="end">3.0%</text>
		<text x="400" y="269" text-anchor="end">7</text>
		<text x="416" y="269" class="dg-ok" style="font-size: 16px">✓ Success</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="540" y="248" width="23" height="32" rx="3"></rect>
	</g>

	<!-- 5. Aware + citation -->
	<text x="12" y="321">Awareness + citation</text>
	<text x="282" y="321" text-anchor="end">222,992</text>
	<text x="348" y="321" text-anchor="end">4.1%</text>
	<text x="400" y="321" text-anchor="end">10</text>
	<text x="416" y="321" class="dg-ok" style="font-size: 16px">✓ Success</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="540" y="300" width="129" height="32" rx="3"></rect>
	</g>

	<!-- 6. Adaptive window -->
	<text x="12" y="373">Adaptive window</text>
	<text x="282" y="373" text-anchor="end">174,601</text>
	<text x="348" y="373" text-anchor="end">102.4%</text>
	<text x="400" y="373" text-anchor="end">7</text>
	<text x="416" y="373" class="dg-ok" style="font-size: 16px">✓ Success</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="540" y="352" width="101" height="32" rx="3"></rect>
	</g>

	<!-- Key -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="4" y="404" width="712" height="120" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="360" y="432" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">Context-aware compression: 76% fewer tokens than</text>
		<text x="360" y="456" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">no compression, tied for fewest iterations</text>
		<text x="360" y="486" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Key: Incorporate query intent and existing information</text>
		<text x="360" y="510" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">into compression decisions</text>
	</g>
</svg>
